          "en": "A concert in the garden"
        },
        "text": {
          "zh": "19世纪60年代，巴黎时髦的人们，会到杜伊勒里花园听每周两次的户外音乐会。马奈和朋友们常去，他在那里画了很多速写。",
          "en": "In the 1860s, fashionable Parisians gathered in the Tuileries Gardens for twice-weekly open-air concerts. Manet often went with his friends and made many sketches there."
        }
      },
      {
        "title": {
          "zh": "第二幕 · 现代生活",
          "en": "Modern life"
        },
        "text": {
          "zh": "1862年，他画下了这群人。他画的不是神话或历史，而是自己身边的现代城市生活，这在当时很新。",
          "en": "In 1862, he painted this crowd. He painted not myth or history, but the modern city life around him, which was new at the time."
        }
